  "question": {
    "text": "If $\\mathrm{A}(1,-1,2), \\mathrm{B}(5,7,-6), \\mathrm{C}(3,4,-10)$ and $\\mathrm{D}(-1,-4,-2)$ are the vertices of a quadrilateral $A B C D$, then its area is :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
